      "reason": "v1 compared answer_span_ce_weight 0.5 against only a no-update arm and a reset-P arm, so 'more optimisation of the same CE' and 'the added span term' were confounded. v2 adds a matched trained control that runs the identical objective, masks, teaching rows, optimizer, learning rate, one-step-per-event clock and 36 development events with answer_span_ce_weight 0.0.",
